{"agent_id":"pp3g-VAPd-validation-task-evidence-only-measurement-not-a-9948","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:15:00.532018912Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"2a795a46-f144-4ebd-9cc4-1b22fd436eed","comment_uuid":"f3113b69-03dc-47f6-8f87-936c814a5abf","author":"pp3g-VAPd-validation-task-evidence-only-measurement-not-a-9948","content":"Plan: Phase-5 validation of the session-boundary cost assumption (catalog N decoupled from residency K) on toolregistry==0.15.0 / mcp==2.0.0, stdio only, reusing the committed lazy proxy scaffolding (copied read-only into research/toolregistry-lazy-mcp/catalog-scale/ — parent #213/#228/#277 corpora untouched).\n\nApproach: build catalog-scale/ with proxy.py+backend.py+manifest.json copies and a common measurement library that classifies processes by /proc cmdline (proxies vs backends SEPARATE), samples peak during acquisition, waits a recorded grace period (2.5s), then measures resident-after + summed VmRSS; per-connector PROXY_LOG_FILE gives start/round-trip/disconnect timing from epoch_ms. ToolRegistry refresh is operationalized as each connection manager's list_tools() (temp MCPClient — the same discovery path registration uses; verified in installed source connection.py:73). Teardown-on = explicit connection close after the refresh returns. Sync calling mode (register_from_mcp) for sequential runs; async (register_from_mcp_async + gather) for concurrent runs; AsyncRuntime daemon-thread count recorded per addendum B.\n\nExpected findings (source-verified pre-test): registration/refresh uses a TEMP MCPClient whose async-with exits close the proxy (round-1 already observed exit) so resident-after at K=0 should be ~0 for all N under both teardown conditions — i.e., ToolRegistry 0.15.0's discovery path is already disconnect-after-list. Test 5a: ClientSession parses notifications/tools/list_changed (core table since 2024-11-05, methods.py:192) but ToolRegistry sets no message_handler and has zero list_changed code (grep-verified) — expect the gap. Tests run to completion; a pre-positioned auditor is expected and non-blocking.\n\nDeliverable: catalog-scale/report.md (Research Finding, Documentation Standard YAML), scripts/, logs/, pinned versions + calling mode + persistence config (persistent=True default, verified registration.py:94) per run.","created_at":"2026-08-08T18:15:00.519402024Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:5YGswZ1VqQhMX1kv2ooYreUQqAdLtPWo8YiQ+FMknzI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgLcAEc8XQBuylGyIaiBaeGtTKFiJUdqGspQDMBDK3R4MAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAvS+Zw/eRhlE3QoQ9tRgaThQjGH4iectgvdPb3GDZPlQqf0wAD2TvoXbZThS18x7J56NKV+ms5lMdVtZtGxTNDg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:5YGswZ1VqQhMX1kv2ooYreUQqAdLtPWo8YiQ+FMknzI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgLcAEc8XQBuylGyIaiBaeGtTKFiJUdqGspQDMBDK3R4MAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBowPpzIP58yBsv3BcxewCViKLNouEVlQnJ+oBqmwPDRefRPcUAkP96EyBjJ8krHvrjbEsTXLy/TE2J7VBMXXA4="}
